[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0010","text":"啊哈～\n大家都很嗨呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0020","text":"呵呵"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0030","text":"嗯、嗯……！\n客人们都很开心呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0040","text":"嗯，比我想象中好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0050","text":"对了～\n去那边拍张照吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0060","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_9999","text":"同班同学"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0080","text":"樋口小姐"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0090","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0100","text":"我看到活动了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0110","text":"诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0120","text":"啊，抱歉抱歉\n我家就在这附近，回去的路上顺便看看"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0130","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0140","text":"……抱歉，打扫什么的\n给你添了不少麻烦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0150","text":"关于那件事……\n希望樋口同学不要放在心上"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0160","text":"……诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0170","text":"希望你能多依赖我一点\n如果是我能帮上忙的事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0180","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0190","text":"我知道樋口同学一直在这样努力\n所以我会支持你的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0200","text":"……谢谢你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_08_0002","text":"Motion"}]
